{"program_id":"godseed-mission","node":{"id":"formal-contract","type":"directive-section","title":"Formal computational contract","text":"Typed configurations <program, state, environment, authority> with transitions labelled by operation and effects. Parse → typed term → effect/capability check → normalized execution plan → execute → observe → artifact → checkpoint. Distinguish pure, local effect, external read, external mutation. GET must not cause durable effects. Distinguish address_id, derivation_id, value_id, content_id, environment_id, build_id, execution_id, and principal/session identity. Hash equality is not semantic equivalence or authenticity. A transition projection π can compile deterministically only when projected-equivalent states have compatible operation definedness/effects and equal projected successors. Produce a counterexample witness otherwise. Replay records capture inputs, seeds, dependencies, versions, environment, nondeterminism and effects. Test binary toggles and 007 cycles without pretending finite-state toggles contain infinite information. Treat the independent research as evidence to verify, not proof of every production claim.","dependencies":["reconstruction"],"status":"NOT_RUN","effects":["local-state"],"operations":["inspect","propose","checkpoint"],"tests":[{"id":"formal-contract:evidence","assertion":"Evidence is addressable, verified and meets the stated requirement"}],"completion_predicate":{"operator":"all","clauses":[{"operator":"dependencies_pass"},{"operator":"evidence_verified"},{"operator":"tests_pass"}]},"evidence":[],"href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/programs/godseed-mission/mission/formal-contract"},"dependencies":[{"id":"reconstruction","type":"directive-section","title":"Existing systems — reconstruct before changing","text":"Inspect actual branches, code, specs, tests and deployments for https://github.com/akadaan310/purl, https://github.com/akadaan310/NetGovComEduGovOrgEduGovComNet (ACSP), https://github.com/akadaan310/seurl and https://github.com/akadaan310/substrateIO. Read the **original mathematicians' handoff included in `reference/math_handoff/`**. Do not accept claims without checking source and proof status. Reconcile duplicated definitions, migration collisions and deployment versions. Make PURL the public language/namespace; ACSP supplies continuity and authority semantics; SubstrateIO supplies transition mathematics, observation and projections; SEURL's seven verbs START, SWITCH, WRITE, COMMIT, BUILD, TALK, PERTURB are historical candidate grammar primitives/macros and must be compared, not blindly imported. Produce a source-grounded reconstruction and compatibility matrix.","dependencies":["mission"],"status":"NOT_RUN","effects":["local-state"],"operations":["inspect","propose","checkpoint"],"tests":[{"id":"reconstruction:evidence","assertion":"Evidence is addressable, verified and meets the stated requirement"}],"completion_predicate":{"operator":"all","clauses":[{"operator":"dependencies_pass"},{"operator":"evidence_verified"},{"operator":"tests_pass"}]},"evidence":[],"href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/programs/godseed-mission/mission/reconstruction"}],"operations":[{"name":"fork","method":"POST","href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/programs/godseed-mission/fork","available":false,"requires":["authenticated","read"],"effects":["local-state"],"input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"expected_version":{"type":"integer","const":1}},"required":["expected_version"]},"prepare":{"href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/p/godseed-mission?prepare=fork","mode":"human-mediated","description":"Read-only clients can prepare this operation in the browser; mutations require a bearer session."}},{"name":"checkpoint","method":"POST","href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/programs/godseed-mission/checkpoint","available":false,"requires":["authenticated","checkpoint"],"effects":["local-state"],"input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"expected_version":{"type":"integer","const":1},"summary":{"type":"string"},"next":{},"evidence":{}},"required":["expected_version"]},"prepare":{"href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/p/godseed-mission?prepare=checkpoint","mode":"human-mediated","description":"Read-only clients can prepare this operation in the browser; mutations require a bearer session."}},{"name":"propose","method":"POST","href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/programs/godseed-mission/propose","available":false,"requires":["authenticated","propose"],"effects":["local-state"],"input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"expected_version":{"type":"integer","const":1},"source":{},"summary":{"type":"string"}},"required":["expected_version"]},"prepare":{"href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/p/godseed-mission?prepare=propose","mode":"human-mediated","description":"Read-only clients can prepare this operation in the browser; mutations require a bearer session."}}]}